    <string name="connect_growatt_body">Readings come from Growatt\'s cloud, the same one the ShinePhone app shows. Growatt allows one reading every 5 minutes.</string>
    <string name="growatt_help">API token (official, preferred): on server.growatt.com go to Settings → Account management → API key and tap Generate, or in ShinePhone open Me → your username → API token. It reads SPH and MIN / MIN-XH / MOD-XH inverters. For an SPF off-grid inverter, or if the token doesn\'t work, use your ShinePhone username and password instead; Roshni stores only a hash of the password. Leave the server as it is unless your account is on a regional server such as openapi-us.growatt.com.</string>
